{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-04_end",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-04",
  "title": "没人在家",
  "storyCode": "5-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a55950938f15e7595ca8974adb05d42b234f3c5e3c7192defb91cab2bf55e161",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "所有整合运动我都逮住了。根本没人知道具体的指令，刚他们说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "老陈？看什么呢，这么入迷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "这里以前是不是大学道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "嗯？是啊。后来改了名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......这似乎是我家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你的公寓不是在太埔吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "这是我生父一族的宅邸，好像重新装修过了。时间过去这么久，我甚至没能认出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你去维多利亚读书之前住这？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "虽然早前听过你和魏先生一样是炎国贵族出身，不过，这宅子可确实够大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "贵族？他们是，我不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "但你这屋邸摆在这......该怎么称呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "哼，陈府......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "进来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "喂喂，这不是你自己家门吗，你就这么切开了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我没带钥匙。整合运动刚刚也在侧墙上开过洞了，他们造成了些意外的破坏也是有可能的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你说是——算了，那就是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不用脱鞋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这真行吗？老陈，认真回答我，你是不是有点讨厌你爸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "他不配当我父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "如果没记错，你从维多利亚毕业以后，一回龙门就直接进了近卫局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那时候我住宿舍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "所以你一次也没回来过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我对这里没有一点留恋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "一般嘴上这么说的人，心里头的事情多得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你对那个什么高价值目标，有头绪吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "老陈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "又沉浸在自己的小世界里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "老陈，门口等你，走的时候叫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "玩具要摆放整齐。\n不准走出家门。\n和别人说话要经过允许。\n没同意前不准直视大人的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "居然一直有在打扫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "哼，一直空着这个房间留给我，真够宽容的，还是说觉得我是丧门星？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "等等，照片，对，照片......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你得不到我的爱，一点也得不到。\n对不起，很对不起，但我无法忍受你，光是看到你，我都恨到想要挠破自己的胳膊。\n你们都让我无法忍受。我太自私了，我确实没法再坚持下去了。\n你们会明白的，总有一天。要恨就恨吧。我恨你，你也恨我。那是最好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我还以为已经丢了，这么早的照片......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不对......他们难道在找这个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "怎么回事，整合运动究竟在做什么？难道你的大脑也出问题了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我一定会帮你，但你在想什么？为什么是现在，为什么是这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "呵......也是。你不会回答我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "啊，你终于出来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "有头绪了？还要再玩会儿毛线球什么的不？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你还有心思开玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我觉得你心情比刚才好上了那么一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "就像你说的，也许我有些头绪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "对了，根据报告，周遭的整合运动确实溃散了，原先分配好的警力正在驱赶他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那就好。我们的道路又畅通了一些，也更接近目标了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "近卫局诸位，整队出发！让我们去把龙门拿回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
